2754..2829 Comment "/// Put-get, put-put and get-get together, the laws a state-passing handler"
2830..2906 Comment "/// is checked against (`../specification/state-wp.gandr`). A read of a read"
2907..2985 Comment "/// under a store is a redex of put-get and of get-get, and both reducts store"
2986..3063 Comment "/// the value and continue at it twice. Get-put beside them is refused in the"
3064..3073 Comment "/// twin."
